    <briefdescription>
<para>Adds Control Flow Guard (CFG) checks on indirect function calls/invokes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These checks ensure that the target address corresponds to the start of an address-taken function. X86_64 targets use the Mechanism::Dispatch mechanism. <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_x86" kindref="compound">X86</ref>, <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_a_r_m" kindref="compound">ARM</ref>, and <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_a_arch64" kindref="compound">AArch64</ref> targets use the Mechanism::Check machanism. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
